      "content": "<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.66ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.404ex\" height=\"2.57ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -844.3 15206.4 1136\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"49\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-49\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(361,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1172,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1172,-276.2) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2494.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3494.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4066.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"49\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-49\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(394,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5282.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(6283.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(7283.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(783,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8944.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(10221.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10721.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"49\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-49\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(394,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(11741.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(12741.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(13241.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(14428.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>What is the value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> ?</p>",
